Four Different Ways to Check If an Array Contains a Value:

* Using ```List```:
```public static boolean useList(String[] arr, String targetValue) {
    return Arrays.asList(arr).contains(targetValue);
}
```
* Using ```Set```:
```public static boolean useSet(String[] arr, String targetValue) {
    Set set = new HashSet(Arrays.asList(arr));
    return set.contains(targetValue);
}
```
* Using a simple loop:
```public static boolean useLoop(String[] arr, String targetValue) {
    for (String s: arr) {
        if (s.equals(targetValue))
            return true;
    }
    return false;
}
```
* Using ```Arrays.binarySearch()```:
The code below is wrong, it is listed here for completeness. ```binarySearch()``` can ONLY be used on sorted arrays. You will find the result is weird below. This is the best option when array is sorted.
```public static boolean binarySearch(String[] arr, String targetValue) {
    return Arrays.binarySearch(arr, targetValue) >= 0;
}
```

Quick Example:
```String testValue="test";
String newValueNotInList="newValue";
String[] valueArray = { "this", "is", "java" , "test" };
Arrays.asList(valueArray).contains(testValue); // returns true
Arrays.asList(valueArray).contains(newValueNotInList); // returns false
```

messages.content:
Fire forskjellige måter å sjekke om en matrise inneholder en verdi:

* Ved å bruke ```List```:
```public static boolean useList(String[] arr, String targetValue) {
    return Arrays.asList(arr).contains(targetValue);
}
```
* Ved å bruke ```Set```:
```public static boolean useSet(String[] arr, String targetValue) {
    Set set = new HashSet(Arrays.asList(arr));
    return set.contains(targetValue);
}
```
* Ved å bruke en enkel løkke:
```public static boolean useLoop(String[] arr, String targetValue) {
    for (String s: arr) {
        if (s.equals(targetValue))
            return true;
    }
    return false;
}
```
* Ved å bruke ```Arrays.binarySearch()```:
Koden nedenfor er feil, den er oppført her for fullstendighet. ```binarySearch()``` kan BARE brukes på sorterte matriser. Du vil finne at resultatet er rart nedenfor. Dette er det beste alternativet når matrisen er sortert.
```public static boolean binarySearch(String[] arr, String targetValue) {
    return Arrays.binarySearch(arr, targetValue) >= 0;
}
```

Raskt eksempel:
```String testValue="test";
String newValueNotInList="newValue";
String[] valueArray = { "this", "is", "java" , "test" };
Arrays.asList(valueArray).contains(testValue); // returnerer true
Arrays.asList(valueArray).contains(newValueNotInList); // returnerer false
```

